@@ -1,1272 +0,0 @@
-/*
- * common code for virtio vsock
- *
- * Copyright (C) 2013-2015 Red Hat, Inc.
- * Author: Asias He <asias@redhat.com>
- *         Stefan Hajnoczi <stefanha@redhat.com>
